    "| **tenure** | Numeric | Number of months the customer has been with the company |\n",
    "| **PhoneService** | Categorical | Has phone service (Yes/No) |\n",
    "| **MultipleLines** | Categorical | Multiple phone lines (Yes/No/No phone service) |\n",
    "| **InternetService** | Categorical | Type of internet (DSL / Fiber optic / No) |\n",
