    "| **PaperlessBilling** | Categorical | Paperless billing (Yes/No) |\n",
    "| **PaymentMethod** | Categorical | How the customer pays |\n",
    "| **MonthlyCharges** | Numeric | Monthly bill amount |\n",
    "| **TotalCharges** | Numeric | Total amount billed to date |\n",
    "| **Churn** | Target | Did the customer leave? (Yes/No) - **only in train.csv** |\n",
    "\n",
    "**Categorical features** hold text labels (e.g. \"Male\", \"DSL\").  \n",
