    "---\n",
    "## 7: Feature Engineering\n",
    "\n",
    "### Why create new features?\n",
    "Raw columns sometimes don't capture the full story. By **combining** or **transforming** existing features we can give the model richer information.\n",
    "\n",
    "| New Feature | Logic | Why it might help |\n",
    "|-------------|-------|-------------------|\n",
    "| **tenure_group** | Bucket tenure into groups (0-12, 13-24, etc.) | Captures non-linear effects of loyalty |\n",
    "| **service_count** | Count how many services a customer subscribes to | More services = more locked in = less likely to churn? |\n",
    "| **avg_monthly_charge** | TotalCharges / (tenure + 1) | Smooths out billing fluctuations |\n",
    "| **charge_per_service** | MonthlyCharges / (service_count + 1) | Cost efficiency per service |"
   ]
