    "              │         │\n",
    "         High churn   Low churn\n",
    "         risk 🔴      risk 🔵\n",
    "```\n",
    "\n",
    "One tree is okay but makes mistakes. So Random Forest builds **300 trees** - each tree sees a random subset of customers and random subset of features.\n",
    "\n",
    "### The Voting System\n",
    "\n",
    "```\n",
    "Customer Sneha enters:\n",
    "  tenure=2, MonthlyCharges=85, Contract=Month-to-month\n",
