    "Tree 300 → Churn ✅\n",
    "\n",
    "Final Vote: 258 say Churn, 42 say No Churn\n",
    "Answer: 0.86 churn probability 🔴\n",
    "```\n",
    "\n",
    "### Real Life Analogy\n",
